<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Desafio 21 Dias — Elline & Juliana</title>
<style>
  :root{
    --bg: #FFF9F0;
    --ink: #201A2E;
    --muted: #7A7188;
    --e: #FF5D3A;
    --e-dark: #D8401F;
    --e-soft: #FFE3D9;
    --j: #00B3A4;
    --j-dark: #00877C;
    --j-soft: #D3F5F1;
    --purple: #7B5CFA;
    --yellow: #FFC93C;
    --line: #F0E4D8;
    --card: #FFFFFF;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body{
    margin:0; background: var(--bg); color: var(--ink);
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .wrap{ max-width: 960px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 20px 90px; }

  .hero{
    background: linear-gradient(120deg, var(--e) 0%, #FF8A3D 32%, var(--purple) 68%, var(--j) 100%);
    padding: 64px 20px 56px;
    border-radius: 0 0 32px 32px;
    color: #fff;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .hero::after{
    content:"";
    position:absolute; right:-60px; top:-60px; width:260px; height:260px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.12); border-radius: 50%;
  }
  .hero::before{
    content:"";
    position:absolute; left:-40px; bottom:-80px; width:200px; height:200px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.10); border-radius: 50%;
  }
  .hero-inner{ max-width: 920px; margin: 0 auto; position: relative; z-index: 2; }
  .kicker{
    display:inline-block;
    letter-spacing: 2px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
    padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 999px;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
  .hero h1{
    font-size: 46px; margin: 0 0 12px; line-height: 1.05; font-weight: 900;
    text-shadow: 0 2px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);
  }
  .hero .dates{
    display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;
    font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;
    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.18); padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: 999px;
  }
  .hero p.lead{ font-size: 16.5px; max-width: 620px; margin: 0; opacity: 0.96; }

  #sync-badge{ display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; margin-top:14px; font-size:12.5px; font-weight:700; background:rgba(0,0,0,0.18); padding:6px 14px; border-radius:999px; }
  #sync-badge.offline{ background: rgba(200,40,40,0.35); }

  .progress-block{ margin-top: 30px; }
  .progress-row{ display:flex; gap:16px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 14px; }
  .progress-card{
    flex:1; min-width: 220px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.97); border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 16px 18px; box-shadow: 0 8px 22px rgba(0,0,0,0.12); color: var(--ink);
  }
  .progress-card .pc-top{ display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:baseline; margin-bottom:8px; }
  .progress-card .pc-label{ font-size:13px; font-weight:800; color: var(--muted); text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.4px; }
  .progress-card.e .pc-label{ color: var(--e-dark); }
  .progress-card.j .pc-label{ color: var(--j-dark); }
  .progress-card .pc-pct{ font-size:22px; font-weight:900; }
  .progress-bar-bg{ background: #EFE9DD; border-radius: 999px; height: 12px; overflow:hidden; }
  .progress-bar-fill{ height:100%; border-radius:999px; width:0%; transition: width 0.4s ease; background: var(--purple); }
  .progress-card.e .progress-bar-fill{ background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--e), #FF8A3D); }
  .progress-card.j .progress-bar-fill{ background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--j-dark), var(--j)); }

  .progress-card.big{ width: 100%; padding: 22px 26px; }
  .progress-card.big .pc-label{ font-size:15px; }
  .progress-card.big .pc-pct{ font-size:34px; }
  .progress-card.big .progress-bar-bg{ height: 20px; }
  .progress-row.two{ flex-wrap: nowrap; }
  .progress-row.two .progress-card{ min-width: 0; }
  @media (max-width: 560px){
    .progress-row.two{ flex-wrap: wrap; }
  }

  .scoreboard{ display:flex; gap:18px; margin-top:22px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .player-card{
    flex: 1; min-width: 260px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.97); color: var(--ink);
    border-radius: 16px; padding: 22px 24px;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
  }
  .player-card .name{ font-size: 21px; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 14px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; }
  .player-card.e .name{ color: var(--e-dark); }
  .player-card.j .name{ color: var(--j-dark); }
  .field{ display:flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items:center; padding: 8px 0; border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--line); font-size: 14px; }
  .field:last-child{ border-bottom:none; }
  .field span.lbl{ color: var(--muted); font-weight: 600;}
  .field input{ border: none; border-bottom: 2px solid #E8DFD2; background: transparent; text-align: right; width: 90px; font-size: 14.5px; font-family: inherit; padding: 3px 0; color: var(--ink); font-weight:700; }
  .field input:focus{ outline: none; border-bottom-color: var(--purple); }

  section{ margin-top: 58px; }
  section .eyebrow{
    display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;
    font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--purple);
    background: #EFE9FF; padding: 5px 14px; border-radius: 999px; margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  section h2{ font-size: 27px; margin: 0 0 6px; font-weight: 900; }
  section p.section-sub{ color: var(--muted); margin: 0 0 22px; font-size: 15px; max-width: 640px; }

  .rules-grid{ display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px; }
  .rule-card{
    background: var(--card); border-radius: 14px; padding: 18px 20px; font-size: 14.5px;
    box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(120,90,50,0.08);
    border-top: 4px solid var(--yellow);
  }
  .rule-card:nth-child(2){ border-top-color: var(--e); }
  .rule-card:nth-child(3){ border-top-color: var(--j); }
  .rule-card:nth-child(4){ border-top-color: var(--purple); }
  .rule-card b{ display:block; margin-bottom: 5px; font-size: 15.5px;}

  .tasks-card{
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #201A2E, #3A2E52);
    color: #FFF9F0; border-radius: 16px; padding: 26px 28px; margin-top: 20px;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 26px rgba(32,26,46,0.25);
  }
  .tasks-card b{ display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; margin-bottom: 14px; font-size: 16px; color: var(--yellow);}
  .tasks-card ul{ margin: 0; padding-left: 0; columns: 2; column-gap: 26px; list-style:none; }
  .tasks-card li{ margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 14.5px; break-inside: avoid; }
  .tasks-card label{ display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; cursor:pointer; }
  .tasks-card input[type=checkbox]{ width: 18px; height: 18px; accent-color: var(--j); cursor:pointer; flex-shrink:0; }

  table.workout{
    width: 100%; border-collapse: separate; border-spacing: 0 8px;
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  table.workout tr{ background: var(--card); }
  table.workout td{ padding: 13px 16px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  table.workout td:first-child{ border-left: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px 0 0 12px; font-weight: 800; }
  table.workout td:last-child{ border-right: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 0 12px 12px 0; color: var(--muted); }
  table.workout td.foco{ font-weight: 700; color: var(--e-dark); }

  .diet-cards{ display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr); gap: 12px; }
  .diet-card{
    background: var(--card); border-radius: 14px; padding: 15px 15px; font-size: 13px;
    box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(120,90,50,0.08);
    border-bottom: 4px solid var(--j);
  }
  .diet-card:nth-child(2){ border-bottom-color: var(--purple); }
  .diet-card:nth-child(3){ border-bottom-color: var(--yellow); }
  .diet-card:nth-child(4){ border-bottom-color: var(--e); }
  .diet-card:nth-child(5){ border-bottom-color: var(--j-dark); }
  .diet-card .day{ font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--ink);}
  .diet-card .item{ color: #555; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .diet-card .item b{ color: var(--ink); font-weight: 700; }
  .meals-note{
    background: linear-gradient(120deg, var(--e-soft), var(--j-soft));
    border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 20px; font-size: 14.5px; margin-top: 18px;
  }

  .week-block{ margin-bottom: 42px; }
  .week-badge{
    display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:10px;
    font-size: 18px; font-weight: 900; margin: 0 0 4px;
    background: var(--purple); color:#fff; padding: 8px 18px; border-radius: 999px;
  }
  .week-block:nth-of-type(2) .week-badge{ background: var(--e); }
  .week-block:nth-of-type(3) .week-badge{ background: var(--j-dark); }
  .week-block .range{ font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--muted); margin: 10px 0 14px; font-weight:600; }

  table.checklist{
    width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; background: var(--card); border-radius: 14px; overflow: hidden;
    font-size: 13.5px; box-shadow: 0 8px 22px rgba(120,90,50,0.10);
  }
  table.checklist th, table.checklist td{ padding: 11px 12px; text-align: center; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  table.checklist td.date{ text-align: left; font-weight: 700; white-space: nowrap; }
  table.checklist th{ font-size: 11.5px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.4px; color: #fff; font-weight:700; }
  table.checklist th.hdr-e{ background: var(--e); }
  table.checklist th.hdr-j{ background: var(--j-dark); }
  table.checklist th.hdr-date{ background: var(--ink); }
  table.checklist td.cell-e{ background: var(--e-soft); }
  table.checklist td.cell-j{ background: var(--j-soft); }
  table.checklist tr:nth-child(odd) td.cell-e{ background: #FFF0E9; }
  table.checklist tr:nth-child(odd) td.cell-j{ background: #E6F8F5; }
  table.checklist tr:last-child td{ border-bottom: none; }
  table.checklist input[type=checkbox]{ width: 19px; height: 19px; accent-color: var(--purple); cursor: pointer; }

  .weekend-result{ display:flex; gap: 16px; margin-top: 14px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .weekend-result .box{
    flex:1; min-width: 220px; background: var(--card); border-radius: 14px; padding: 16px 18px; font-size: 13.5px;
    box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(120,90,50,0.08);
  }
  .weekend-result .box b{ display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--purple); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.4px; }
  .weekend-result input[type=text]{ border: none; border-bottom: 2px solid #E8DFD2; background: transparent; font-size: 14.5px; font-family: inherit; padding: 4px 0; width: 100%; color: var(--ink); font-weight:600; }
  .weekend-result input[type=text]:focus{ outline:none; border-bottom-color: var(--purple); }

  .final-box{
    background: linear-gradient(120deg, var(--yellow), #FFA53C);
    border-radius: 16px; padding: 22px 26px; margin-top: 10px;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 26px rgba(255,169,60,0.3);
  }
  .final-box b{ display:block; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 15px; color: #4A2E00; }
  .final-box input[type=text]{
    border: none; border-bottom: 2px solid rgba(74,46,0,0.35); background: transparent; font-size: 15px;
    font-family: inherit; padding: 5px 0; width: 100%; color: #3A2400; font-weight:700;
  }
  .final-box input[type=text]:focus{ outline:none; }

  .points-explain{ display:flex; gap: 14px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .points-explain .pill{
    background: var(--card); border-radius: 999px; padding: 11px 20px; font-size: 14px; font-weight:600;
    box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(120,90,50,0.08);
  }
  .points-explain .pill b{ color: var(--e-dark); font-size: 16px; }

  /* ---------- TABS ---------- */
  .tabs{ display:flex; gap:10px; margin-top: 32px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .tab-btn{
    font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 800; padding: 12px 22px;
    border-radius: 999px; border: none; cursor: pointer;
    background: var(--card); color: var(--muted); box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(120,90,50,0.08);
  }
  .tab-btn.active{ background: linear-gradient(120deg, var(--purple), var(--e)); color: #fff; }

  /* ---------- RECEITAS ---------- */
  .recipe-day-card{
    background: var(--card); border-radius: 14px; padding: 20px 22px; margin-bottom: 18px;
    box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(120,90,50,0.08); border-left: 5px solid var(--purple);
  }
  .recipe-day-card .rd-top{ margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .recipe-day-card .rd-day{ font-size: 19px; font-weight: 900; }
  .recipe-day-card .block-label{ font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--muted); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.3px; margin: 16px 0 8px; }
  .recipe-day-card select{
    font-family: inherit; font-size: 14px; font-weight:700; padding: 9px 14px; border-radius: 10px;
    border: 2px solid var(--line); background: #FAF8F4; color: var(--ink); cursor:pointer; width: 100%;
  }
  .chip-row{ display:flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; }
  .chip{
    display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; padding: 7px 14px; border-radius: 999px;
    border: 2px solid var(--line); background: #FAF8F4; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: #555;
    cursor: pointer; user-select: none; transition: all 0.15s ease;
  }
  .chip input{ position: absolute; opacity: 0; width:0; height:0; }
  .chip.checked{ background: linear-gradient(120deg, var(--purple), var(--e)); border-color: transparent; color: #fff; }
  .molho-detail{ margin-top: 10px; background: #FAF8F4; border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px 14px; }
  .molho-detail .item{ font-size: 13px; color: #444; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .molho-detail .item b{ color: var(--ink); font-weight:700; }

  /* ---------- TODAS AS RECEITAS ---------- */
  .ref-block{ margin-bottom: 30px; }
  .ref-block h3{ font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 12px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--purple); }
  .ref-block .chip-row .chip{ pointer-events: none; }
  .molho-cards{ display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 12px; }
  .molho-card{
    background: var(--card); border-radius: 14px; padding: 16px 18px;
    box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(120,90,50,0.08); border-top: 4px solid var(--j);
  }
  .molho-card:nth-child(3n+2){ border-top-color: var(--e); }
  .molho-card:nth-child(3n){ border-top-color: var(--purple); }
  .molho-card .mc-nome{ font-weight: 800; font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .molho-card .item{ font-size: 13px; color: #444; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .molho-card .item b{ color: var(--ink); font-weight:700; }
  @media (max-width: 700px){ .molho-cards{ grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

  footer{
    margin-top: 76px; padding: 30px 0 10px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 13.5px; text-align: center; font-weight:600;
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px){
    .rules-grid{ grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .diet-cards{ grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    .hero h1{ font-size: 32px; }
    table.checklist{ font-size: 11.5px; }
    table.checklist th, table.checklist td{ padding: 7px 4px; }
    table.workout{ font-size: 13px; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="hero">
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <span class="kicker">🏆 DESAFIO DE CASAL · 21 DIAS</span>
    <h1>Elline vs. Juliana</h1>
    <div class="dates">📅 13/09/2026 → 03/10/2026</div>
    <p class="lead">Marquem todo santo dia: treinou, ganhou ponto 💪. Comeu certo, ganhou ponto 🥗. No fim de cada semana, quem tiver menos pontos lava a louça (ou faz o que for combinado) da outra.</p>
    <div id="sync-badge">🔄 Sincronizando...</div>

    <div class="progress-block">
      <div class="progress-card big">
        <div class="pc-top"><span class="pc-label">Progresso geral do desafio</span><span class="pc-pct" id="progress-all-label">0%</span></div>
        <div class="progress-bar-bg"><div class="progress-bar-fill" id="progress-all-bar"></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="progress-row two">
        <div class="progress-card e">
          <div class="pc-top"><span class="pc-label">🧡 Elline</span><span class="pc-pct" id="progress-e-label">0%</span></div>
          <div class="progress-bar-bg"><div class="progress-bar-fill" id="progress-e-bar"></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="progress-card j">
          <div class="pc-top"><span class="pc-label">💚 Juliana</span><span class="pc-pct" id="progress-j-label">0%</span></div>
          <div class="progress-bar-bg"><div class="progress-bar-fill" id="progress-j-bar"></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="scoreboard">
      <div class="player-card e">
        <div class="name">🧡 Elline</div>
        <div class="field"><span class="lbl">Peso inicial</span><input type="text" id="e-peso-inicial" placeholder="0,0 kg"></div>
        <div class="field"><span class="lbl">Meta de peso</span><input type="text" id="e-meta-peso" placeholder="0,0 kg"></div>
        <div class="field"><span class="lbl">Semanas vencidas</span><input type="text" id="e-semanas" placeholder="0 / 3"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="player-card j">
        <div class="name">💚 Juliana</div>
        <div class="field"><span class="lbl">Peso inicial</span><input type="text" id="j-peso-inicial" placeholder="0,0 kg"></div>
        <div class="field"><span class="lbl">Meta de peso</span><input type="text" id="j-meta-peso" placeholder="0,0 kg"></div>
        <div class="field"><span class="lbl">Semanas vencidas</span><input type="text" id="j-semanas" placeholder="0 / 3"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="wrap">

  <div class="tabs">
    <button class="tab-btn active" id="btn-tab-desafio" onclick="showTab('desafio')">🏆 Desafio</button>
    <button class="tab-btn" id="btn-tab-receitas" onclick="showTab('receitas')">🥗 Receitas &amp; Cronograma</button>
    <button class="tab-btn" id="btn-tab-todas" onclick="showTab('todas')">📖 Todas as Receitas</button>
  </div>

  <div id="tab-desafio">
  <section id="regras">
    <span class="eyebrow">📜 As regras</span>
    <h2>Como funciona o desafio</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">21 dias, divididos em 3 semanas. Pontuação diária, resultado semanal, prêmio no final.</p>
    <div class="rules-grid">
      <div class="rule-card"><b>⭐ Como pontuar</b>Treino do dia cumprido = 1 ponto. Dieta do dia seguida = 1 ponto. Até 2 pontos por dia, por pessoa.</div>
      <div class="rule-card"><b>🧹 Quem perde a semana</b>Quem somar menos pontos ao final dos 7 dias vira "funcionária da casa" da outra até a próxima pesagem.</div>
      <div class="rule-card"><b>🤝 Empate</b>Sem tarefa nenhuma — ou decidam no par-ou-ímpar pra não ficar sem graça.</div>
      <div class="rule-card"><b>🏆 Prêmio final</b>Quem vencer mais semanas (2 de 3 ou as 3) é a campeã. A perdedora geral cumpre uma tarefa "grande" combinada antes de começar.</div>
    </div>

    <div class="tasks-card">
      <b>🧺 Cardápio de tarefas — marquem 3 ou 4 pra valer no desafio</b>
      <ul>
        <li><label><input type="checkbox" id="task-1"> Lavar a louça do dia inteiro</label></li>
        <li><label><input type="checkbox" id="task-2"> Dobrar e guardar toda a roupa</label></li>
        <li><label><input type="checkbox" id="task-3"> Passar pano na casa</label></li>
        <li><label><input type="checkbox" id="task-4"> Tirar o lixo a semana toda</label></li>
        <li><label><input type="checkbox" id="task-5"> Cozinhar o jantar de alguém</label></li>
        <li><label><input type="checkbox" id="task-6"> Fazer a faxinha do banheiro</label></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="points-explain" style="margin-top:18px;">
      <div class="pill"><b>7</b> pontos possíveis de dieta/semana</div>
      <div class="pill"><b>7</b> pontos possíveis de treino/semana</div>
      <div class="pill"><b>3</b> semanas no total</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="checklist">
    <span class="eyebrow">✅ O placar</span>
    <h2>Checklist diário</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">Marquem todo dia — atualiza pras duas na hora. No fim de cada semana, somem os pontos e preencham quem ganhou.</p>

    <div class="week-block">
      <div class="week-badge">🔥 Semana 1</div>
      <div class="range">13/09 (dom) a 19/09 (sáb) — dias 1 a 7</div>
      <table class="checklist">
        <tr>
          <th class="hdr-date" rowspan="2">Data</th>
          <th class="hdr-e" colspan="2">Elline</th>
          <th class="hdr-j" colspan="2">Juliana</th>
        </tr>
        <tr><th class="hdr-e">Treino</th><th class="hdr-e">Comeu certo</th><th class="hdr-j">Treino</th><th class="hdr-j">Comeu certo</th></tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="date">13/09 — Dom</td>
